bldg:Room1.04
    hbco:roomCapacity     30 ;
    ontosage:capacityBasis "drawing-adopted; owner decision 2026-10-07 (second round) replaced the 25-estimate with the architect's drawing figure for Room 1.04 (30, label '30P Seminar' on the floor plan) -- the drawing is more specific than the generic estimate reconciliation. Not certified -- Estates holds the authoritative figure." .

# Retained capacity records for Room 1.04. The TTL figure above is the estimate record's value,
# and the estimate supersedes the retired 2026-09-30 maxOccupancy figure. The architect's drawing
# is a second source, read only when the TTL holds no figure for the room (owner decision
# 2026-10-07). Schema: "Both are retained" (ontosage:supersedes).
bldg:CapacityRecord_Room1.04_estimate
    rdfs:label "Room 1.04 capacity, 2026-09-30 estimate (current TTL figure)"@en ;
    rdfs:seeAlso bldg:Room1.04 ;
    hbco:roomCapacity     30 ;
    ontosage:capacitySource "ttl" ;
    ontosage:supersedes bldg:CapacityRecord_Room1.04_retired ;
    ontosage:capacityBasis "drawing-adopted (current TTL figure); owner decision 2026-10-07 (second round) replaced the 25-estimate with the architect's drawing figure for Room 1.04 (30, label '30P Seminar' on the floor plan) -- the drawing is more specific than the generic estimate reconciliation. Not certified -- Estates holds the authoritative figure." .

bldg:CapacityRecord_Room1.04_retired
    rdfs:label "Room 1.04 maxOccupancy 50, 2026-09-30 (retired)"@en ;
    rdfs:seeAlso bldg:Room1.04 ;
    hbco:roomCapacity     50 ;
    ontosage:capacitySource "ttl" ;
    ontosage:capacityBasis "retired; the building's own maxOccupancy declared 50 on 2026-09-30 and it was superseded by the lower estimate. Retained for audit; never answered with." .

bldg:CapacityRecord_Room1.04_drawing
    rdfs:label "Room 1.04 capacity from the architect's drawing (second source)"@en ;
    rdfs:seeAlso bldg:Room1.04 ;
    hbco:roomCapacity     30 ;
    ontosage:capacitySource "drawing" ;
    ontosage:capacityBasis "drawing: architect's floor plan bldg1/Abacws floor 1.dxf, text label '30P Seminar' nearest to room tag '1.04' (the PDF floor plan shows the same label). Second source: read only when the TTL holds no figure for the room. Figure is the drawing's person count, not certified — Estates holds the fire-certified figure." .

